    24	## Specificity test and reference comparison
    25	
    26	For each page, quote its actual hero line from the approved copy deck, mask the brand name and compare its meaning with two unrelated business categories. If both could use it unchanged, mark `generic-hero` FAIL. A factual descriptor, named audience job or specific proposition must make the line belong to this brief. Do not invent competitor quotations. The writer owns revisions and existing approval still applies.
